# class: repo-map
# schema: path | purpose | owner-role | category
# source: repo walk (top-level + significant nested) + per-dir READMEs
# recipe: builtin:repo-structure
# reindexed: 2026-05-23 (full repo-walk refresh; added .config/, install/, backend/fetcher, backend/fetcher-host, gateway/demo-gha, gateway/demo-driver, root governance files, testing/integration, expanded testing/fixtures; mockup path updated to docs/ui/mockups/)

backend/ | .NET 10 — co-located Write + Read API services (host api/ + write-api/ + read-api/ + shared/ libraries + Dashboard.sln) + fetcher tier (fetcher/ + fetcher-host/); microservices architecture per ADR-0006, co-location mechanics per ADR-0002 | backend-engineer | source
backend/api/ | Host project Dashboard.Api + Dashboard.Api.Tests — composition root + sole Dockerfile + single ACA container target (Write + Read services co-located in deployment-dashboard-api per ADR-0006); self-applies EF migrations on startup per ADR-0009 | backend-engineer | source
backend/write-api/ | Write endpoint group library Dashboard.WriteApi (+ Tests) — POST /api/deployments; NOTIFY dispatch; POST /api/fetcher/usage; PUT /api/fetcher/state/{source-id} | backend-engineer | source
backend/read-api/ | Read endpoint group library Dashboard.ReadApi (+ Tests) — matrix, history, discovery, SSE, /health, GET /api/fetcher/usage, GET /api/fetcher/state | backend-engineer | source
backend/shared/ | Shared library Dashboard.Shared (+ Tests) — DbContext, entities, migrations, API-key middleware, NOTIFY/LISTEN, SSE writer, DTOs, IFetcherUsageCache (ADR-0008 in-memory cache) | backend-engineer | source
backend/fetcher/ | Dashboard.Fetcher library (+ Tests) — ICiCdAdapter interface, GitHubActionsAdapter, scheduler, Polly retry, rate-limit cap (CR-0011/ADR-0008 leaky-bucket) | backend-engineer | source
backend/fetcher-host/ | Dashboard.Fetcher.Host ASP.NET Worker + Dockerfile — composition root for the optional pull-mode adapter; image=deployment-dashboard-fetcher; outbound-only container (NFR-04 strict; minReplicas=maxReplicas=1 per ADR-0004) | backend-engineer | source
frontend/ | Angular 20 standalone+zoneless workspace; Tailwind; NgRx Signal Store | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/dashboard/ | Application shell — main.ts, styles.css, proxy.conf.json, Dockerfile (nginx static + SPA build) | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/matrix/ | @dd/matrix library — pipeline matrix + per-view templates + attribute picker | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/drawer/ | @dd/drawer library — history drawer | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/shared/ | @dd/shared library — Signal Store + API client + SSE service + models + fixtures | frontend-engineer | source
gateway/ | nginx reverse proxy — single public ingress on :8080; routing matrix; SSE pass-through tuning | devops-engineer | infra-edge
gateway/demo-gha/ | Baked WireMock.Net demo-gha image — Dockerfile + README; first-party deployment-dashboard-demo-gha image; CR-0013; built by demo-gha.yml CI caller | devops-engineer | infra-edge
gateway/demo-driver/ | Python demo-driver sidecar — entrypoint.py (stdlib only; walks ticks/ subdirs; PUTs/POSTs to demo-gha admin API on DEMO_DRIVER_PERIOD_SECONDS interval); Dockerfile + README; CR-0013 §3e amendment per issue #46 | devops-engineer | infra-edge
install/ | Release-install tier — docker-compose.release.yml (canonical service inventory per ADR-0010; image-only; no build: blocks) + install.{ps1,sh} + uninstall.{ps1,sh}; installer generates dashboard.env (API_TOKEN + DASHBOARD_VERSION + secrets) | devops-engineer | infra-edge
dev_env/ | Docker Compose contributor override (docker-compose.local.yml layered on install/docker-compose.release.yml per ADR-0010) + standalone scaled stack + PowerShell start/stop scripts | devops-engineer | local-dev
.config/ | dotnet-tools.json — dotnet-ef pin (.NET 10); consumed by local contributor migration authoring (dotnet ef migrations add); no longer used in CI (migration-script gen retired by ADR-0009) | devops-engineer | tooling
docs/ | Architecture spec, ADRs, CRs, UI option docs, WBS, CI/CD integration + pipelines + integration-tests guides, Jekyll site | solution-architect | governance
docs/adr/ | Architecture Decision Records (ADR-0001..ADR-0010) + README; ADR-0009 supersedes ADR-0005; ADR-0010 paired with ADR-0009 | solution-architect | governance
docs/cr/ | Change Requests (CR-0001..CR-0013) + README | team-lead (primary D25) + solution-architect | governance
docs/ui/ | UI option docs (7 files) + ui/index.md Jekyll landing + mockups/ directory | frontend-engineer (mockup), solution-architect (option docs semantics) | governance
docs/ui/mockups/ | Canonical mockup (deployment-dashboard.html, 253416 bytes, relocated from docs/ui/ per PR #62) + variant HTML files (env-tag-column-alignment-variant-a.html, env-tag-column-alignment-variant-b.html per issue #23) | frontend-engineer | governance
testing/ | xUnit functional + integration + Playwright e2e + Playwright mockup-visual + PowerShell scripts + fixtures + config | qa-engineer | testing
testing/functional/ | xUnit functional API tests (run-tests.ps1 + Dashboard.Functional.Tests/) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/integration/ | xUnit cross-stack integration suite (Dashboard.Integration.Tests/; CR-0012 substrate; fetcher -> mock-gha -> gateway -> API -> DB -> SSE; FETCHER_POLL_INTERVAL_SECONDS=1) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/e2e/ | Playwright end-to-end suite (run-tests.ps1 + playwright.config.ts + scenarios/ + tests/) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/mockup-visual/ | Playwright mockup geometric invariants harness (no stack required) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/scripts/ | seed.ps1 (POST prefilled events via Ingest API) + Pester start.Tests.ps1 / stop.Tests.ps1 (assert dual-file -f invocation per ADR-0010) + .bats integration harness | qa-engineer | testing
testing/config/ | Test runner configs (e.g. local.json with writeBaseUrl + apiKey) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/fixtures/ | Shared test data (seed-data.json) + GHA fixture corpus (gha/) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/fixtures/gha/ | WireMock.Net fixture corpus for integration + demo; mappings/ (per-endpoint base) + scenarios/<state-id>/ (6 canonical box states from ui-states.yaml) + scenarios/_cross-cutting/ (NFR-05 + ADR-0004 cursor) + demo/ (baked into demo-gha image per CR-0013) | qa-engineer | testing
.github/ | GitHub-side config — actions/notify/ composite; ISSUE_TEMPLATE/; PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md; 11 workflows under workflows/ | devops-engineer | ci
.github/actions/notify/ | Composite action for the CI/CD notify step (per WBS §1.4.2; CR-0001) | devops-engineer | ci
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/ | Bug-report + feature-request templates (ginee:ready label auto-applied per CONTRIBUTING.md D14 flow) + config.yml (blank issues disabled; security advisory redirect) | team-lead | governance
.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md | PR template scaffold (What/Why/Cites/Issue-linkage/Domain-breakdown/Cross-domain-sign-offs/Cost-impact/Verification-log sections; no PR without authority citation) | team-lead | governance
.agents/ | ginee framework install (vendor-neutral) | project-manager | tooling
.agents/ginee/ | Framework root (core/ + adapters/ + local/ + extras/) | project-manager | tooling
.claude/ | Claude Code adapter — installed skills + agents | project-manager | tooling
README.md | Project README — quickstart, features summary, links to docs site; "AI-implemented end-to-end" note; MIT license badge | team-lead | governance
CONTRIBUTING.md | Contributor guide — ginee workflow, filing issues, PR process, local dev pointers, doc-edit routing table | team-lead | governance
SECURITY.md | Security policy — supported versions, vulnerability reporting via GitHub Security Advisories, scope (NFR-04 internal-only; write API X-Api-Key gated), out-of-scope declarations | solution-architect | governance
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md | Code of conduct — Contributor Covenant v2.1; scope + reporting + enforcement | team-lead | governance
CHANGELOG.md | Changelog — Keep a Changelog format + SemVer; Unreleased section only (no tagged releases yet) | team-lead | governance
LICENSE | MIT license | project-manager | governance
CLAUDE.md | Project-instruction file — ginee pointer block | project-manager | governance
TODO | Repo-root TODO list (MVP backlog + Phase 2.0) | project-manager | governance
excluded | node_modules / dist / bin / obj / playwright-report / test-results / __screenshots__ — not extracted | - | excluded
